      For example if we apply 1-1 exchange in the solution
      ``A = [3, 2, 1, 4, 3]``
      we can get the following by the transposition of 1 and 4 elements:
      ``A' = [3, 2, 4, 1, 3]``
    - ""1-0"": 1-0 exchange which moves an node in the solution
