.. [2] `Wikipedia: Hyper-Wiener Index <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hyper-Wiener_index>`_

Examples
--------
>>> G = nx.path_graph(4)
>>> nx.hyper_wiener_index(G)
30.0

>>> G = nx.cycle_graph(4)
