        generate a new host key or authentication key.

        :param progress_func: Not used for this type of key.
        :returns: A new private key (`.ECDSAKey`) object
        """"""
        if bits is not None:
            curve = cls._ECDSA_CURVES.get_by_key_length(bits)
            if curve is None:
