.. [1] Freeman, L.C., 1979. Centrality in networks: I.
   Conceptual clarification.  Social Networks 1, 215--239.
   https://doi.org/10.1016/0378-8733(78)90021-7
.. [2] Sariyuce, A.E. ; Kaya, K. ; Saule, E. ; Catalyiirek, U.V. Incremental
